    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39433" root="نجس" body-key="n">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنجّس</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَجِسَ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <i>He did a deed whereby to become free from uncleanness, dirt, filth,</i> or
<i>impurity;</i> (K;) like as you say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأَثَّمَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَرَّجَ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَنَّثَ</span>, meaning, he did a deed whereby to
become free from crime, sin, &amp;c. (TA.)


